WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.101 line:0%
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-And finally, New Rule.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.369 line:0%
For all the progressives
and academics

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:05.471 line:0%
who refer to Israel
as an outpost

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.374 line:0%
