every goddamn liberal precept

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.683 line:0%
that liberals
are supposed to adore.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.285 line:0%
(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.793 line:0%
Individual liberty,
scientific inquiry, rule of law,

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.630 line:0%
religious freedom,
women's rights, human rights,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.133 line:0%
democracy, trial by jury,
freedom of speech.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.170 line:0%
Please, somebody stop us
before we enlighten again.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.605 line:0%
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:39.805 --> 00:00:42.008
And since one can find
all these concepts

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:44.644
in today's Israel
and virtually nowhere else

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.045
in the Middle East, if anything,

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.480
the world would be
a better place

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.114
if it had more Israels.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:52.952
Of course, this message falls
on deaf ears to the current crop

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:55.555
who reduce everything
to being only victims

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:58.391
or victimizers,
so Israel is lumped in

00:00:58.457 --> 00:01:01.460
as the toxic fruit
of the victimizing West.

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:05.064
The irony being that
all marginalized people

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:08.601
live better today
because of Western ideals,

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.935
not in spite of them.

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:12.205
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-Ma--

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:21.447
Martin Luther King used
Henry David Thoreau's essay,

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:23.416
<i> Civil Disobedience,</i>
to help shape

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:24.951
the civil rights movement.

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:28.621
The UN's Universal Declaration
of Human Rights owes its core

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:30.356
to Rousseau and Voltaire.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:34.394
Cleisthenes never showed up
for a sexual harassment seminar.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.929
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.565
But without him,
there's no democracy.

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.835
The cop who murdered
George Floyd got 21 years

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.204
for violating
his Fourth Amendment rights,

00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:47.840
an idea we got
directly from John Locke,

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:50.443
