and so White, and so dead.

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.548
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.122
So Western.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:05.525
Yes, that's how simple
the woke are,

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.159
